380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 211 0 R
/T (Density-Based Priority Zones: The dashboard automatically clusters detected problems to visualize structural priority. Areas with a high density of severe issues are highlighted in Red \(Immediate Action Required\), areas with moderate damage or fewer issues are marked in Orange \(Scheduled Maintenance\), and minor wear is marked in Yellow \(Monitoring\). Automated Workflow: Municipal engineers can click on a "Red Zone," review the aggregated visual evidence from citizens and CCTVs, and instantly generate a prioritized repair ticket for contractors.)
/E (Density-Based Priority Zones: The dashboard automatically clusters detected problems to visualize structural priority. Areas with a high density of severe issues are highlighted in Red \(Immediate Action Required\), areas with moderate damage or fewer issues are marked in Orange \(Scheduled Maintenance\), and minor wear is marked in Yellow \(Monitoring\). Automated Workflow: Municipal engineers can click on a "Red Zone," review the aggregated visual evidence from citizens and CCTVs, and instantly generate a prioritized repair ticket for contractors.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [18]
>>
